title: Factory Cells
subtitle: Organise the party where the workers work, not where they live.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_cells_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_cells_timer = 4

= Factory Cells

The International urges the German party to build cells in the factories instead of local branches in the neighbourhoods. The old branches resist.

- @build
- @later

@build
title: Build factory cells in the big works.
subtitle: More union influence and a stronger apparatus; the old branches grumble.
on-arrival: {!
Q.union_influence += 3;
Q.apparatus += 2;
Q[Q.leader + '_moscow'] += 1;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Cells form at Siemens, Leuna and the Ruhr pits.

@later
title: Wait for a better time.
subtitle: No cost.
on-arrival: {!

window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

The reorganisation is put off.
